# PhaserSupabaseTemplate

Follow `AGENTS.md` for project conventions.

- This repo is a reusable template; class repos are yearly copies students actually use
- Phaser + TypeScript + Vite; Supabase for data
- Keep Supabase calls in `src/services/`
- Each student uses a personal local-dev Supabase project in `.env`
- Class production Supabase keys go in the class repo’s GitHub Actions variables for Pages
- Demo only checks connectivity. Do not turn it into a full auth/game system unless asked
- Never put the secret key in client code
- Do not add React, Spring Boot, or Docker unless asked
